    "Layout radii/sizes: prefer Unity SolarSystem sockets + DistantProxy local offsets (TimberHearth_Socket z=-8593, BrittleHollow -11691, GiantsDeep -16458, DarkBramble -20000, Comet_Socket -24000 snapshot; twins \u00b1250 about HourglassCenter; Attlerock Proxy_THM z\u2248900 under Moon_Pivot in TimberHearth_DistantProxy; Hollow's Lantern under VolcanicMoon_Pivot in BrittleHollow_DistantProxy). Kaydara proxies/*.fbx are NOT the mesh source. orbits.json semiMajorAxis for circular planets should match those Unity sockets; HGT barycenter 5000m is the designed heliocentric SMA (ship-map AU=1) \u2014 scene snapshot placement of HourglassTwins is not authoritative. Interloper ellipse params remain datamine approximations (socket is a snapshot).",
    "Wallpaper does NOT run the 22-minute apocalypse: sun size stays fixed, Interloper is never swallowed, orbits loop forever.",
    "Use orbits_per_22min only to set relative angular speeds (period ratios). Optionally time-scale the whole system for aesthetics.",
    "Omit The Stranger and the three Hearthian/deep-space satellites per project scope.",
    "Sun Station / OPC / White Hole Station are optional flavor; proxies exist if wanted later.",
    "semiMajorAxis values stay in game meters; period_seconds_wallpaper_ref is derived from user orbit counts."
